msgstr ""

#: ../../tools/omnipath_tools.rst:110 a75f287be0dc4397a6f1649e2e735174
msgid ""
"``confidence_levels`` (string, null) (optional) Comma-separated DoRothEA "
"confidence levels to include (e.g., 'A,B' for high confidence only). "
"Options: A, B, C, D, E. Default: all levels."
msgstr ""

